    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1163-a1">

                <pb facs="1360" n="1162" sameAs="frus:frus1945Berlinv02/pg1162"/>

                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Enclosure—Extract]</seg>
                </opener>
                <p>As a result of discussions between United Kingdom, United States and Soviet
                    delegations at <hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >Terminal</hi> Soviet Government have agreed to resume
                    participation in European Inland Transport Conference in London as soon as
                    Polish Provisional Government have accepted invitation to send a delegation to
                    the Conference and have indicated when that delegation could reach London.</p>
                <p rendition="#center">. . . . . . . . . . . . . .</p>
            </div>
        </body>
